<title>JAPAN: Shimizu files 100 bln yen shelf registration.</title>
<headline>Shimizu files 100 bln yen shelf registration.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shimizu Corp said on Wednesday it had filed a shelf registration with the Finance Ministry to issue up to 100 billion yen of corporate bonds, effective for two years from February 25.</p>
</text>
